{u} : N/\\mathfrak m_A N \\to M/\\mathfrak m_A M$ is injective,"], "original_source_statement_tex": "\\label{lemma-upstairs-finite-type-injective-into-flat-mod-m}\nLet $A \\to B$ be a local ring homomorphism of local rings which is\nessentially of finite type. Let $u : N \\to M$ be a $B$-module map.\nIf $N$ is a finite $B$-module, $M$ is flat over $A$, and\n$\\overline{u} : N/\\mathfrak m_A N \\to M/\\mathfrak m_A M$ is injective,\nthen $u$ is $A$-universally injective, $N$ is of finite presentation over\n$B$, and $N$ is flat over $A$.", "pass3_eligible": false, "published": false, "schema": "maththm.four-complete-chapters.standalone-editorial-draft.v1", "section_ambient_hypotheses_auto_inherited": [], "section_end_line": 7551, "section_index": 186, "section_key": "s186", "section_start_line": 6995, "section_title": "Variants of a lemma", "source_enumerated_clauses": [], "source_filename": "flat.tex", "source_formal_environment": "lemma", "source_formal_environment_end_line": 7139, "source_formal_environment_start_line": 7131, "source_inline_reference_labels": [], "source_label": "lemma-upstairs-finite-type-injective-into-flat-mod-m", "source_logical_form": "plain_source_statement", "source_named_reference_labels": [], "source_proof_screened": false, "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_statement_line": 7131, "source_url": "https://github.com/stacks/stacks-project/blob/a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14/flat.tex#L7131", "standalone_statement_tex": "Let $A \\to B$ be a local ring homomorphism of local rings which is\nessentially of finite type. Let $u : N \\to M$ be a $B$-module map.\nIf $N$ is a finite $B$-module, $M$ is flat over $A$, and\n$\\overline{u} : N/\\mathfrak m_A N \\to M/\\mathfrak m_A M$ is injective,\nthen $u$ is $A$-universally injective, $N$ is of finite presentation over\n$B$, and $N$ is flat over $A$."}
