that $N/\\mathfrak m N \\to M/\\mathfrak m M$ is injective\nfor all maximal ideals $\\mathfrak m$ of $A$, then $u$ is\n$A$-universally injective.\n\\end{enumerate}"], "original_pass2_hypotheses_proposed": ["In (\\ref{equation-star}) if there exists a pure spreadout,"], "original_source_statement_tex": "\\label{lemma-properties-pure-spreadout}\nIn (\\ref{equation-star}) if there exists a pure spreadout, then\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item elements of $N$ have content ideals in $A$, and\n\\item if $u : N \\to M$ is a morphism to a flat $A$-module $M$\nsuch that $N/\\mathfrak m N \\to M/\\mathfrak m M$ is injective\nfor all maximal ideals $\\mathfrak m$ of $A$, then $u$ is\n$A$-universally injective.\n\\end{enumerate}", "pass3_eligible": false, "published": false, "schema": "maththm.four-complete-chapters.standalone-editorial-draft.v1", "section_ambient_hypotheses_auto_inherited": [], "section_end_line": 7551, "section_index": 186, "section_key": "s186", "section_start_line": 6995, "section_title": "Variants of a lemma", "source_enumerated_clauses": ["elements of $N$ have content ideals in $A$, and", "if $u : N \\to M$ is a morphism to a flat $A$-module $M$\nsuch that $N/\\mathfrak m N \\to M/\\mathfrak m M$ is injective\nfor all maximal ideals $\\mathfrak m$ of $A$, then $u$ is\n$A$-universally injective."], "source_filename": "flat.tex", "source_formal_environment": "lemma", "source_formal_environment_end_line": 7238, "source_formal_environment_start_line": 7228, "source_inline_reference_labels": ["equation-star"], "source_label": "lemma-properties-pure-spreadout", "source_logical_form": "shared_existential_witness_properties", "source_named_reference_labels": ["equation-star"], "source_proof_screened": false, "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_statement_line": 7228, "source_url": "https://github.com/stacks/stacks-project/blob/a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14/flat.tex#L7228", "standalone_statement_tex": "In (\\ref{equation-star}) if there exists a pure spreadout, then\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item elements of $N$ have content ideals in $A$, and\n\\item if $u : N \\to M$ is a morphism to a flat $A$-module $M$\nsuch that $N/\\mathfrak m N \\to M/\\mathfrak m M$ is injective\nfor all maximal ideals $\\mathfrak m$ of $A$, then $u$ is\n$A$-universally injective.\n\\end{enumerate}"}
