-ideal}\nLet $A$ be a local ring. Let $I \\subset A$ be an ideal.\nLet $U \\subset \\Spec(A)$ be quasi-compact open.\nLet $M$ be an $A$-module. Assume that\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $M/IM$ is flat over $A/I$,\n\\item $M$ is flat over $U$,\n\\end{enumerate}\nThen $M/I_2M$ is flat over $A/I_2$ where\n$I_2 = \\Ker(I \\to \\Gamma(U, I/I^2))$.", "pass3_eligible": false, "published": false, "schema": "maththm.four-complete-chapters.standalone-editorial-draft.v1", "section_ambient_hypotheses_auto_inherited": [], "section_end_line": 7551, "section_index": 186, "section_key": "s186", "section_start_line": 6995, "section_title": "Variants of a lemma", "source_enumerated_clauses": ["$M/IM$ is flat over $A/I$,", "$M$ is flat over $U$,"], "source_filename": "flat.tex", "source_formal_environment": "lemma", "source_formal_environment_end_line": 7398, "source_formal_environment_start_line": 7387, "source_inline_reference_labels": [], "source_label": "lemma-make-smaller-flatness-ideal", "source_logical_form": "listed_premises_then_conclusion", "source_named_reference_labels": [], "source_proof_screened": false, "source_revision": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_statement_line": 7387, "source_url": "https://github.com/stacks/stacks-project/blob/a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14/flat.tex#L7387", "standalone_statement_tex": "Let $A$ be a local ring. Let $I \\subset A$ be an ideal.\nLet $U \\subset \\Spec(A)$ be quasi-compact open.\nLet $M$ be an $A$-module. Assume that\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item $M/IM$ is flat over $A/I$,\n\\item $M$ is flat over $U$,\n\\end{enumerate}\nThen $M/I_2M$ is flat over $A/I_2$ where\n$I_2 = \\Ker(I \\to \\Gamma(U, I/I^2))$."}
